ryl Crow, Josh Duhamel, Diana Krall, Brian Wilson, Donna Summer, Nicole Kidman, Gary Coleman, k.d. lang, Jerry Lee Lewis, Natalie Cole, Gloria Estefan, Neil Diamond, Laurence Fishburne, Gladys Knight, Frances Bean Cobain, and Rod Stewart.", "biography_author": "Wikidata", "date_of_biography": "2023-09-06T00:50:19.365564+10:00", "external_links": [{"id": 6149, "uri": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rocky_Schenck"}], "uuid": "e475fdc2-4d6e-4f7e-9656-9e6af76ce3ec", "source": {"name": "Vernon", "slug": "vernon"}, "source_identifier": "1620", "external_references": [{"id": 33289, "source": {"name": "Wikidata", "slug": "wikidata"}, "source_identifier": "Q2081364"}, {"id": 55694, "source": {"name": "VIAF", "slug": "viaf"}, "source_identifier": "63145970042332250670"}, {"id": 55695, "source": {"name": "LOC Auth", "slug": "loc-auth"}, "source_identifier": "n2003006975"}, {"id": 55696, "source": {"name": "WorldCat", "slug": "worldcat"}, "source_identifier": "lccn-n2003006975"}], "date_modified": "2023-09-06T00:50:19.389140+10:00"}, {"id": 75882, "name": "Bill Paxton", "roles_in_work": [{"id": 2242737, "title": "Fish heads", "work_id": 77121, "role": "co-producers/directors", "role_id": 628, "is_primary": true}], "also_known_as": "", "date_of_birth": "1955-05-17", "date_of_death": "2017-02-25", "genders": [{"id": 9, "name": "Male", "slug": "male"}], "languages": [{"id": 1, "name": "English", "slug": "english"}], "places_of_operation": [{"id": 1, "name": "United States of America", "slug": "united-states-of-america"}], "biography": "William  Paxton (May 17, 1955 – February 25, 2017) was an American actor and filmmaker. He is known for starring in films such as Aliens (1986), Near Dark (1987), Tombstone (1993), True Lies (1994), Apollo 13 (1995), Twister (1996), Titanic (1997), Mighty Joe Young (1998), and A Simple Plan (1998). He had supporting roles in Weird Science (1985), Edge of Tomorrow (2014), and Nightcrawler (2014).\nPaxton starred in the HBO drama series Big Love (2006–